{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/p0.png?t=1744717806\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TOY SCRAPPERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique multiplayer horror and escape game for 2 to 16 players! Become a crazy clown and hunt down your prey, or play as a toy and try to survive the madness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1744717806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVE THE MADNESS, STAY ALIVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a toy caught in the middle of crazy clowns, hide and try to stay alive without being caught. Increase your chances of survival with special abilities!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decoy</strong>: Create a copy of yourself to confuse your pursuers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prop</strong>: Turn into an object and blend into your surroundings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Illusion</strong>: Spawn 8 copies of yourself to vanish in the chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Invisibility</strong>: Disappear completely and escape without a trace!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1744717806\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME A CRAZY CLOWN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a clown, your goal is to find the hidden toys on the map. Hunt them down and turn them to your side! Use your special abilities to trap them!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trap</strong>: Place a trap on the ground and wait for them to get caught!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sense</strong>: Feel nearby enemies and locate them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1744717806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TOY SCRAPPERS</strong> offers an unforgettable experience filled with laughter and thrills to share with friends. <strong>Will you be the hunter or the hunted?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"WHERE IT ALL BEGAN!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/c88c4b378f43b44c0869157e646053dbdac61d43.jpg"},{"name":"CREATE A LOBBY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/bf2f8636b93c5ffd88e88138030194262b1d41d9.jpg"},{"name":"JOIN A LOBBY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/8a00589015838fe2ec74368c14dd9bae506d7b3e.jpg"},{"name":"WHO IS THE KILLER?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/304e5c5e2cdfefbe42e9c4978b842dc8c36341c0.jpg"},{"name":"RUN FOR YOUR LIFE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/3a932c76895cb50e1804eadea5da32e48d7da6ed.jpg"},{"name":"YOU GOT HIM!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/6fb93561c49d411558a7b0fbd7425ee0a8b11b8e.jpg"},{"name":"YOU GOT CAUGHT!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/b975213386cda52ff60f0ac4f2c006d0ed07bf38.jpg"},{"name":"YOU ARE SAVED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/c614700e3446c964dc57c22491b72014d8a57df5.jpg"},{"name":"WE CAUGHT THEM ALL!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3457790/3d17be51ada2d8d74abfbaf120f1ca97a2b9343f.