lass=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/p0.png?t=1744717806\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TOY SCRAPPERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique multiplayer horror and escape game for 2 to 16 players! Become a crazy clown and hunt down your prey, or play as a toy and try to survive the madness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1744717806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVE THE MADNESS, STAY ALIVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a toy caught in the middle of crazy clowns, hide and try to stay alive without being caught. Increase your chances of survival with special abilities!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decoy</strong>: Create a copy of yourself to confuse your pursuers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prop</strong>: Turn into an object and blend into your surroundings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Illusion</strong>: Spawn 8 copies of yourself to vanish in the chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Invisibility</strong>: Disappear completely and escape without a trace!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1744717806\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BECOME A CRAZY CLOWN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a clown, your goal is to find the hidden toys on the map. Hunt them down and turn them to your side! Use your special abilities to trap them!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trap</strong>: Place a trap on the ground and wait for them to get caught!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sense</strong>: Feel nearby enemies and locate them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1744717806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TOY SCRAPPERS</strong> offers an unforgettable experience filled with laughter and thrills to share with friends. <strong>Will you be the hunter or the hunted?</strong></p>","developers":["LoudScream"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457790/header.jpg?t=1744717806","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257096127,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096127/movie480.mp4?t=1739117967","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096127/movie_max.mp4?t=1739117967"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096127/376482db0c6524786e331836ee3294ed41ddfdc6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739117967","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096127/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739117967","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096127/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739117967"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257090712,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090712/movie480.mp4?t=1738080653","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090712/movie_max.mp4?t=1738080653"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257090712/2a077999308feb4ae9b9f50b9be706bf2f39ad4f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738080653","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090712/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738080653","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto